<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Zehra Aslan | Lion Fight Club & Kickboks Dünya Şampiyonu</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0f17;
            --card-bg: #161f30;
            --accent-color: #e11d48;
            --gold-color: #f59e0b;
            --text-color: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color); line-height: 1.6; }

        .hero {
            min-height: 85vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(11, 15, 23, 0.7) 0%, rgba(11, 15, 23, 1) 100%), 
                        radial-gradient(circle at center, #1e293b 0%, #0b0f17 100%);
            border-bottom: 2px solid #1e293b;
        }

        .badge-group { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .badge { background-color: var(--accent-color); color: white; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .badge-gold { background-color: var(--gold-color); color: #000; }

        .hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #fff; }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 25px; }

        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px; }
        section { margin-bottom: 60px; }

        h2 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 30px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color); padding-left: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }

        .bio-text { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #cbd5e1; background: var(--card-bg); padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #1e293b; }

        .gym-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #161f30 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-color);
            padding: 35px; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .gym-services { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .gym-service-item { background: #0b0f17; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #334155; }

        .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }

        .card { background-color: var(--card-bg); padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #1e293b; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 4px; height: 100%; background-color: var(--gold-color); }

        .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 15px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 20px; }
        .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background-color: var(--accent-color); color: white; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; transition: transform 0.2s; }
        .btn-instagram { background: linear-gradient(45deg, #f09433 0%, #e6683c 25%, #dc2743 50%, #cc2366 75%, #bc1888 100%); }
        .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

        footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header class="hero">
        <div class="badge-group">
            <span class="badge">Milli Sporcu</span>
            <span class="badge badge-gold">WAKO World Grand Master</span>
        </div>
        <h1>ZEHRA ASLAN</h1>
        <p>Kickboks Dünya Şampiyonu & Lion Fight Club Kurucusu</p>
        
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/zzhraaslan1" target="_blank" class="btn btn-instagram">
            Kişisel Instagram (@zzhraaslan1)
        </a>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <section id="hakkimda">
            <h2>Biyografi</h2>
            <div class="bio-text">
                <p>
                    Dünya Kickboks Organizasyonları Birliği (WAKO) bünyesinde ulaşılabilecek en üst seviye unvanlardan biri olan <strong>WAKO World Grand Master</strong> derecesine sahip milli sporcuyum. Kariyerimdeki dünya şampiyonluklarının yanı sıra, kendi kulübüm olan <strong>Lion Fight Club</strong> bünyesinde yeni şampiyonlar ve spor sevdalıları yetiştirmeye devam ediyorum.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="salon">
            <h2>Spor Kulübümüz</h2>
            <div class="gym-card">
                <h3 style="color: var(--gold-color); font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">🦁 LION FIGHT CLUB</h3>
                <p>Dünya Şampiyonu Zehra Aslan gözetiminde profesyonel Kickboks, disiplinli antrenman ve kişiye özel gelişim programları.</p>
                
                <div class="gym-services">
                    <div class="gym-service-item">🥊 Kickboks (Grup Dersleri)</div>
                    <div class="gym-service-item">⭐ Birebir Özel Ders (PT)</div>
                    <div class="gym-service-item">🏆 Müsabık / Yarışmacı Grubu</div>
                    <div class="gym-service-item">🔥 Kondisyon & Lapa Antrenmanı</div>
                </div>

                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 25px;">
                    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/zzhraaslan1" target="_blank" class="btn btn-instagram">
                        Lion Fight Club Instagram
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="basarilar">
            <h2>Kariyer Özet</h2>
            <div class="grid-3">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3 style="color: var(--gold-color);">World Grand Master</h3>
                    <p>WAKO Uluslararası Ustalık Unvanı</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3 style="color: var(--gold-color);">Dünya Şampiyonu 🥇</h3>
                    <p>WAKO Kickboks Altın Madalya</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3 style="color: var(--gold-color);">Milli Takım</h3>
                    <p>Elit Sporcu & Başantrenör</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Zehra Aslan | Lion Fight Club. Tüm hakları saklıdır.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
